@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActivityBorderColor black
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor black
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ArrowThickness 1

title AD-01 (System level) — Plant Health Analysis & Publication Workflow

|SystemManager|
start
:Trigger AI disease detection (UC-26);

|AgriDrone System|
:Scan imagery & extract disease detections;
:Match detections with plant poles via Haversine (tolerance 2.5m);

if (Any detections > 2.5m drift?) then ([Yes: Outliers])
  :Flag outlier locations as Pending Review (UC-26);
  |SystemManager|
  :Review flagged outlier locations (UC-29);
  :Resolve flagged locations (Snap / Mark new / Dismiss);
  |AgriDrone System|
else ([No outliers])
endif

:Propose preliminary disease outbreak zones (UC-26);

|SystemManager|
:Inspect plant health analysis map (UC-27);
:Review suspected disease detections & crops (UC-28);

if (Disease symptom valid?) then ([Valid])
  :Confirm disease detection & health status (UC-28);
else ([False Positive])
  :Reject detection & restore healthy status;
endif

:Adjust disease zone boundaries\n(Merge / Reshape / Memberships) (UC-30);
:Review treatment guidance & attach custom notes (UC-31);
:Submit preliminary survey approval (UC-32);

|AgriDrone System|
:Update survey result status to Approved;

|SystemManager|
:Publish survey results (UC-33);

|AgriDrone System|
:Update status to Published, persist Outbox & send event;
:Dispatch publication notification to TenantOwner;

|TenantOwner|
:View published survey results & disease map (UC-34);
:Download farm health PDF report (UC-34);
stop

@enduml
